I'm playing slashem a lot. I remind you that wishing for artifacts
(like the unbelievably helpful walletofP) can end in emptiness if you
do it too late. That's the one artifact that I wish for since it never
appears. But do it early, before sacfests and such.

Blessed figurine of solar is really fun. Outfit him with all your extra
goodies and stand back. If you go solar, then think of wishing things
for him. Don't forget magic whistle.

If you've never done a doppleganger, then polycontrol/sustain is a good
combo. If you like to teleport, get the rings to make that happen.

It may take two wishes, but you can set yourself up for some new
tactics with your wishes. For an archer, the teleport option is
nice--just back away from your target. And an archer really needs
light, too.

Enough babbling. Enjoy your wishes!



